         <title>Dust Lane Enhancer 1.2.3</title>
         <description>
            <p>Deepens dust lanes and dark filaments, found by their shape rather than their brightness. Use it on a stretched, preferably starless, image. After installing, it is under Script &gt; Utilities &gt; DustLaneEnhancer.</p>
         </description>
